5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Good day to you all. Let us approach this trial with calm hearts and open minds. Trust is a fragile thing, but it is the only bridge to our victory.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Logic and observation will be our best tools here. Let's keep our discussions focused and avoid jumping to conclusions too quickly.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm gonna find the bad wolf for sure! Hehe, you better be scared, Mr. Wolf!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. It's a pleasure to meet you all. I hope we can work together harmoniously to find the answer. I'll do my best to help.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will be observing. Let us proceed with caution and analyze the patterns of speech. Intuition is unreliable; only evidence matters.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, Ryuji. While evidence is key, the spirit of a person often reveals more than their words. Let us listen to each other.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"While I appreciate the sentiment, Servas, we cannot rely on ""spirit"" in a game of deception. We need a structured way to identify the werewolf.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Mizuki, you're so serious! Maybe the wolf is just hiding behind a big, scary face! Or maybe they're acting super nice!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"Sakura-san is very energetic, isn't she? It's refreshing. I think we should all try to stay positive while we search for the truth.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Energy does not equate to information. I will spend this day assessing who among us is attempting to steer the conversation away from logic.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"It is natural to be cautious. However, remember that we are all companions in this journey. Let us support one another as we seek the light.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Support is fine, but blind trust is a liability. I'll be watching for any inconsistencies in how people respond to the Seer's eventual revelations.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm gonna keep a super close eye on everyone! I'll find a clue that nobody else sees! Just watch me!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Mizuki-san that we should be careful, but I also believe in Servas-san's kindness. Let's find a balance between trust and caution.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,Balance is a reasonable goal. I will continue to analyze the dynamics of this group. I have no further comments for now.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,A wise conclusion. Let us enter the first night with peace in our souls. May the truth reveal itself to those who seek it.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'm ready. Let's see what the first day brings.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Goodnight everyone! Sleep tight, and don't let the wolf bite! Teehee!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,Goodnight. I hope everyone has a peaceful sleep.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
