32,1,1,talk,Servas,,The sun rises again. I hope you all rested well. Let us share our thoughts and move forward with a spirit of cooperation.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Now that the first divination has occurred, the Seer should consider how to share their information without becoming an immediate target.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Wakey wakey! Did anyone have a scary dream? Or maybe the Seer found something super cool! Tell us, tell us!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning. I'm a bit nervous, but I'm ready to listen. Does anyone have any suspicions or information they'd like to share?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I have information. Servas is human. I am the Seer. I believe it is more efficient to be transparent now to establish a foundation of trust.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Ryuji, your honesty is commendable. To step forward as the Seer is a brave act that provides us all with a guiding light.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Ryuji, that's a bold move. While it helps the village, it also puts a target on your back. I'll take your word for now, but I'll be watching.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Whoa! Ryuji is the Seer! That's so cool! So Servas is a good guy! Now we just have to find the wolfy!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Thank you for telling us, Ryuji-san. It makes me feel a bit safer knowing we have a starting point. I trust your judgment.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I am aware of the risk. However, the risk of the village failing due to a lack of information is greater than the risk to my own safety.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Since we have a confirmed human in Ryuji and myself, we can narrow our focus. Let us look at the others with a gentle but discerning eye.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If Ryuji is the Seer, the werewolf is among Sakura, Midori, or myself. We should look for who is trying too hard to blend in.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hey! Don't look at me! I'm just a little girl! I'm too cute to be a scary wolf, right? Right?!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'm a bit flustered to be a suspect... but I understand. I'll try to be as open as possible so you can see I'm just a villager.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Sakura's behavior is consistent with her personality, which makes her a difficult target for analysis. Midori is being overly polite.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us not be too hasty in our judgments. Even the most unusual behavior can be a mask for a kind heart, or a shield for a frightened soul.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Kindness is a virtue, Servas, but in this game, it can be a weapon. I suspect Midori's excessive politeness might be a cover.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I think we should vote for the person who looks the most suspicious! But I don't know who that is yet! This is hard!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki-san, I'm sorry if I seem suspicious. I'm just naturally shy and want everyone to get along. I really am a villager.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I have not seen enough evidence to be certain. However, based on the current flow, Midori's reactions are the most guarded.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
