65,2,1,talk,Servas,,"A tragedy has befallen us. Midori-san was a gentle soul, and now Ryuji-san has been taken from us. The darkness is closing in.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,Ryuji was the Seer. The werewolf killed him immediately after he revealed himself. This was the most logical move for the wolf.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Nooo! Ryuji is gone! And Midori too! This is getting scary! Who is the wolfy?! I'm gonna find you!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Servas,,"We must remain strong. Even in the face of loss, we can find the strength to do what is right. We are now only three.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"With Ryuji gone, we have no more divinations. It's down to Servas, Sakura, and me. One of us is the werewolf, and one is the possessed.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Servas"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, what?! One of us is a bad guy? But I'm a good girl! @Mizuki, you're the one who wanted to vote for Midori!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, let us not let fear turn us against each other. Mizuki was merely following the logic presented by the Seer.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Exactly. I followed Ryuji's lead. If I were the werewolf, I would have tried to steer the vote away from someone the Seer might have checked.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"But maybe you're just really good at lying! I'm suspicious of you now, Mizuki! You're too smart!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom is not a crime, Sakura. However, we must decide. If we execute the wrong person, the wolf wins. Let us think deeply.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"If I am the wolf, I need to convince you both to trust me. If Sakura is the wolf, she's playing the ""cute"" card to avoid suspicion.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm not playing a card! I'm just me! I think Mizuki is the wolf! I'm voting for her!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
